  "notes": "The National Agricultural Development Company (NADEC; ticker 6010) audited consolidated financial statements for the year ended 31 December 2025 with FY2024 comparatives, from the full audited PDF in the 'Annual / 2025' cell of the Saudi Exchange company-profile 'Financial Statements' tab (Resources/fsPdf/472_0_2026-02-04...). Auditor: KPMG Professional Services Company. The consolidated financial statements were approved by the Board of Directors on 1 February 2026 (corresponding to 13 Sha'aban 1447H). Amounts are presented in full Saudi Riyals (scale 1). The five primary statements (printed FS pages 6-10) are scanned images in the filed PDF (transcribed from page renders at 2.6x); the notes are digital text. Consolidated group; equity has no non-controlling interest, and there are no discontinued operations. NADEC is an integrated dairy and agriculture producer, so it carries biological assets: the non-current 'Biological assets' is folded into other_noncurrent_assets (with 'Long term prepayments') and the current 'Biological assets' into inventory (with 'Inventories') - there is no dedicated biological-assets catalog field. intangible_assets is 'Intangible assets'. investments_associates is 'Investment in joint venture'; long_term_investments is 'Equity investments at FVOCI'. impairment_charges is the '(Impairment losses)/reversal of impairment losses on trade receivables and other receivables, net' line (a charge in FY2025, a reversal in FY2024). other_income is 'Other income' and other_expense is 'Other gains/(losses), net' (a net loss in both years). operating_income is the reported 'OPERATING PROFIT'. finance_income is 'Financing income'; finance_costs is 'Financing cost'; share_of_profit_associates is 'Share of results of joint venture'. other_nonoperating_income is the FY2024 one-off 'Gain from the reclassification of a joint venture to an investment at FVOCI' (SAR 356.5m; nil in FY2025). income_before_income_taxes_and_zakat is 'PROFIT BEFORE ZAKAT AND TAX'; income_taxes_and_zakat sums 'Zakat for current year', 'Zakat reversal related to previous years' and 'Income Tax'. additional_paid_in_capital is 'Share premium'; treasury_shares is 'Treasury shares' (nil FY2024); other_reserves combines the 'Statutory reserve' (released to retained earnings in FY2025 under the new Companies Law) and 'Other reserves'. long_term_debt / current_debt are the non-current 'Murabaha loans and borrowings' and the sum of 'Murabaha loans and borrowings - short term' and its 'current portion'. lease_liabilities_noncurrent / lease_liabilities_current are the non-current / current lease liabilities. defined_benefit_obligation is 'Employee' defined benefits obligation'. other_noncurrent_liabilities combines 'Deferred income' and the non-current 'Financial guarantee liability'; accounts_payable is 'Trade payables, accrued expenses and other payables'; other_current_liabilities combines the current 'Financial guarantee liability', 'Undistributed rights issue compensation' and 'Dividend payables'; zakat_payable is 'Provision for Zakat'. depreciation_amortization sums 'Depreciation of property, plant and equipment', 'Depreciation of right-of-use assets', 'Depreciation of biological assets' and 'Amortization of intangible assets' from the cash-flow statement. capex is 'Additions to property, plant and equipment'; interest_paid sums the 'Interest paid' and 'Interest elements of Lease payments' in financing activities; zakat_paid sums 'Zakat paid' and 'Income Tax paid'; dividends_paid is 'Dividend paid'. foreign_exchange_effect is the 'Effect of exchange rates fluctuations on cash held'. The cash-flow closing balance equals the balance-sheet 'Cash and cash equivalents' line exactly. Statement page references are the printed FS page numbers: financial position 6, profit or loss 7, changes in equity 9, cash flows 10.",
